Highlights:
This aptasensor realized the multiple ECL detection of kanamycin and neomycin with single luminophore. MIL-53(Fe) has excellent conductivity and large surface area which acted as the loading platform of CdS QDs. $\bullet$ The develop method performed low detection limits, wide linearity and good reproducibility.
